As other posters have pointed out you would need to keep the
pet long enough to grow up, then abandon your pet dragon
until it goes feral, then kill it for the potential scales.  That's a
lot of work with no guarantee at the end.  By that time you
may well get the scales you want from dragons at either of the
castles or from the Castle wand.

There is a good reason for doing this that is not about the
scales - If your class rides, dragons make some of the best
steads.  Raising a black/silver/gray dragon from egg to adult
then saddling it does not depend on the random change of
getting scales from the corpse.  Likely worth doing if you do
want to poly self by choice.


